==Usage==

# Preselect 3 connected [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|ControlPoly4]] objects in the [[3D_View|3D View]].
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_Rotate.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_Rotate}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → ControlGrid44_Rotate}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid44_3_Rotate''' object is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''ControlGrid44_3_Rotate''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|C1 - Inputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Poly0|Link}}: First control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|Poly1|Link}}: Second control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|Poly2|Link}}: Third control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|reverse|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Reverses the parameter direction.
* {{PropertyData|tolerance|Float}}: Default is {{value|1e-06}}. Point-to-point connection tolerance for the 3 corners.

{{Properties_Title|C2 - Outputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|Poles|VectorList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.

{{Properties_Title|C3 - Identifiers}}

* {{PropertyData|internalName|String}}: The permanent internal FreeCAD name for this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_type|String}}: Default is {{value|ControlGrid44_3_Rotate}}. The workbench class used to create this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_version|String}}: The class version of this object.


